        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, high voltage, water utility Zug, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, high voltage, water utility Zug, at grid
This dataset describes the transmission of high voltage electricity.;
UUID: c65ceb83-5a36-351e-873d-98bfe043f94f
Included are the electricity production in the water utility Zug, the transmission network and direct emissions to air (ozone and N2O). Electricity losses are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to the supply area of the electric utility Obwalden.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistical data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c65ceb83-5a36-351e-873d-98bfe043f94f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
